(footprint "PD_TO46_FGA01FC_3pin"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "hand")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Thorlabs FGA01FC InGaAs photodiode, TO-46(mod) can in an FC/PC bulkhead. PANEL-MOUNTED body: the flange screws to the front panel and only the three 11 mm leads are bent down into the board, so this footprint is the 3 lead holes only - Two NPTH mounting holes (2.2 mm dia, 13.4 mm apart, same centre line as pins 1/3) match the flange holes so a pair of 90-degree brackets can brace the can to the board. Leads sit on a 2.5 mm dia circle: pin 1 and pin 3 diametrically opposed, pin 2 at 90 deg. Holes 0.8 mm for a ~0.45 mm lead - generous for bent leads, but NOT larger: pads sit only 1.768 mm apart (90 deg on a 2.5 mm circle), so a 1.8 mm pad physically overlaps its neighbour. 1.4 mm pad leaves a 0.368 mm gap. VERIFY the anode/cathode-to-pin-number mapping against the physical part before wiring: the datasheet gives only a schematic symbol, no pin table.")
	(tags "photodiode InGaAs TO-46 FC/PC bulkhead Thorlabs FGA01FC panel mount")
